  - "open science"
  - "non-compensatory reading"
abstract: >-
  A directional instrument for recording long-horizon aspirations and
  observable movement toward them. It returns one of four directional
  readings per aspiration against a versioned registry and deliberately
  computes no aggregate: there is no virtue score, and NOT_OBSERVED means
  no valid entry was admitted rather than that nobody looked.
